WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.560
We've passed on all we know.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.200
A thousand generations live in you now.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.940
But this is your fight.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.260
We'll always be with you.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.260
No one's ever really gone.

